2025-10-07 19:32:37,239 [WARNING] Skipped idx=437: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='In humans, five N-terminal isoforms of p73 have been identified, including TAp73, DeltaNp73, DeltaN'p73, Ex2p73, and Ex2/3p73. TAp73 is one of these isoforms, characterized by the presence of the full-length N-terminus. The other isoforms result from alternative splicing and include deletions or truncations of the N-terminal transactivation domain. These isoforms can differentially regulate gene expression and cellular processes, contributing to various physiological and pathological conditions, including cancer.'
