2025-10-07 19:32:37,288 [WARNING] Skipped idx=452: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='In humans, three TAp73 isoforms have been identified: TAp73α, TAp73β, and TAp73γ. These isoforms result from the use of different alternative promoters and splicing variants of the TP73 gene. Each isoform can exert distinct functions, although they all share the common pro-apoptotic activity. The expression of these isoforms is tightly regulated and can be influenced by various cellular conditions, including stress and DNA damage. PIR2, as a ring finger ubiquitin ligase, has been shown to play a role in the degradation of the dominant-negative DeltaNp73 isoforms, thereby modulating the balance between TAp73 and DeltaNp73, which is crucial for determining cell fate, particularly in the context of apoptosis.'
